msgid "<p>The Editoria11y <strong><em>@type</em></strong> view is missing.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Falta la vista <strong><em>@type</em></strong> de Editoria11y.</p>"

msgid ""
"<p>There are three view configurations this module installs, found in its /"
"config/install folder. Each must be installed for this dashboard to display "
"results.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Este módulo incluye tres configuraciones de vistas en /config/install. "
"Deben instalarse para que el panel muestre resultados.</p>"

msgid ""
"<p>To fix: copy and paste the contents of <strong>/editoria11y/config/"
"install/views.view.ed11y_@type.yml</strong> into a \"View\" type import at "
"<a href=\"/admin/config/development/configuration/single/import\">/admin/"
"config/development/configuration/single/import</a>. If you sync your "
"configuration to the filesystem, be sure to include these Views in your "
"repository.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Para corregir: copie el contenido de <strong>/editoria11y/config/install/"
"views.view.ed11y_@type.yml</strong> y péguelo en una importación de tipo "
"«Vista» en <a href=\"/admin/config/development/configuration/single/"
"import\">/admin/config/development/configuration/single/import</a>. Si "
"sincroniza configuraciones con el sistema de archivos, incluya estas Vistas "
"en su repositorio.</p>"

